- [ ] `MainActivity.kt` already enables transparent edge-to-edge bars. Its base screen content is inset before the tab backgrounds are drawn, leaving the status area painted by the root surface. Move ownership of the background outside that top inset. Let Carousel, album detail, and Now Playing draw their active colors or artwork beneath the status icons, and let Library, Settings, and Search extend their corresponding surface color into that strip. Keep safe drawing insets on headings, controls, and scrollable content as appropriate.
